{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"spell_counterspell","model_identifier":"spell_counterspell","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# spell_counterspell\n\nSupport-mage counterspell: a sharp white-green ring that snaps shut round an enemy caster (from radius 30 u to 8 u) and shatters the spell into shards. Centred on the caster at chest height (y 36).\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -32..32, y 35..38, z -32..32 units (1.77 x 0.11 x 1.77 m). Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 32 x 32, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering; every visible face has its own region painted with its material at world position (identical faces share one). No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: 21.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 63 x 4 x 63 (w x h x d), centred at x 0, z 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `snap` | 0.4 | once | segments slam inward from r 30 to r 8 by 0.18 s, then five shards burst outward and up (0.18-0.4 s) |\n\n- Glowing cubes (`glow_*`): glow_seg0, glow_seg0_edge, glow_seg1, glow_seg1_edge, glow_seg2, glow_seg2_edge, glow_seg3, glow_seg3_edge, glow_seg4, glow_seg4_edge, glow_seg5, glow_seg5_edge ...\n\n## Notes\n\n- Bright simple glowing shapes; every lit cube is named `glow_*` (flat colours; the game may scale, spin and fade them). No particles or lights in the file.\n"},"resolution":{"width":32,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"glow_seg0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[29.0,35.0,-10.0],"to":[31.0,37.0,10.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0,36,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[20.0,20.0,22.0,22.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[8.0,0.0,28.0,2.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[20.0,20.0,22.0,22.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[8.0,0.0,28.0,2.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":